        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Aaryan Shukla is a 14-year-old boy from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "India",
            "zh": "印度"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He is very, very good at maths. People call him a “human "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "calculator",
            "zh": "计算器"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "” because he can do big maths problems in his head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day, Aaryan "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "broke",
            "zh": "打破"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " six world "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "records",
            "ref": "v-record"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in just one day! He added 100 big numbers in only 30 seconds. He also "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "multiplied",
            "zh": "乘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "huge",
            "ref": "v-huge"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " numbers faster than anyone else in the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Aaryan "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practises",
            "ref": "v-practise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " maths every single day for many hours. He says he loves numbers because they are fun and full of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "patterns",
            "zh": "规律"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When he got his world records, he said, “It’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "a dream come true",
            "zh": "梦想成真"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!” His parents and teachers were so "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "proud",
            "ref": "v-proud"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of him."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Aaryan shows that when we practise and never "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "give up",
            "zh": "放弃"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", we can get better at anything we love—even very hard things like maths!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
